aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":213072,"global_rank":260719,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41910},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauritzen","html_url":"https://github.com/dlauritzen/SqlRest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A super-thin MySQL REST API","topics":[],"score":213066,"global_rank":260727,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41911},{"name":"jdlambert/wyag","owner":"jdlambert","html_url":"https://github.com/jdlambert/wyag","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Building git from scratch","topics":[],"score":213063,"global_rank":260742,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41912},{"name":"jfullerton44/DoctorsWebScraper","owner":"jfullerton44","html_url":"https://github.com/jfullerton44/DoctorsWebScraper","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":3,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213060,"global_rank":260750,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41913},{"name":"EntilZha/result","owner":"EntilZha","html_url":"https://github.com/EntilZha/result","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Implementation of Rust Result in python","topics":[],"score":213060,"global_rank":260779,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41914},{"name":"mikehelmick/jservice-starter","owner":"mikehelmick","html_url":"https://github.com/mikehelmick/jservice-starter","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213060,"global_rank":26078